        "text_jWBhEg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Simran Design was appointed to develop the interior design concept for Amid Palace Indian Restaurant in Nuneaton, transforming the space into a refined dining environment capable of accommodating over 100 guests.</p><p>Following an initial site visit, consultation and full measure-up, we developed the design through floor plans, mood boards and material palettes before producing detailed 3D visualisations to bring the concept to life.</p><p>We designed a new bar area, reception and waiting space, a dedicated photo moment for guests, and an exclusive VIP dining room. Our role focused on the design, while working alongside the client’s chosen contractors to execute the fit-out.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
